OL,3,GNEWSACommunity heroes honoured at BBC
OL,4,Aawards
OL,5,
OL,6,FVolunteers, campaigners and community
OL,7,Fgroups tackling issues from knife crime
OL,8,Fto disability support have been
OL,9,Fhonoured at BBC Radio WM's Make a
OL,10,FDifference Awards 2026.
OL,12,FWinners recognised at a ceremony at
OL,13,FBirmingham Hippodrome included a
OL,14,Fhospice volunteer who set up a support
OL,15,Fgroup for bereaved men and a pony that
OL,16,Fhas helped young people with
OL,17,Fdisabilities gain confidence and
OL,18,Findependence.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
