OL,3,GNEWSACommunity heroes honoured at BBC
OL,4,Aawards
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe awards, launched during the
OL,7,FCovid-19 pandemic, celebrate people
OL,8,Fmaking a difference in their local
OL,9,Fcommunities.
OL,11,FMike Nash, a volunteer at Marie Curie
OL,12,FHospice, received the Volunteer Award.
